const jailbreakRooms=[
 ['ACT I','Cell 17','Beyond the bars, a guard patrols the main security room. The cell bars protect you from his searchlight.','Search the safe cell and open the side-wall security vent. The guard can only catch you outside the cage.'],
 ['ACT II','The Broken Cellblock','Holes split the floor and several abandoned cells stand open. The north gate uses a physical key.','Explore the open cells, dig through the loose floor, open the keypad evidence room, and recover the north-gate key.'],
 ['ACT III','Security Control','Camera feeds cover every exit. Four breaker switches control the lockdown.','Disable the cameras in the correct order.'],
 ['ACT IV','The Prison Yard','Searchlights rake the concrete. The outer wall is crowned with razor wire.','Build an escape rope and climb the marked wall.'],
 ['ACT V','The Storm Drain','A concrete tunnel runs beneath the outer wall. A locked floodgate blocks the channel.','Find the cutting tool and open the floodgate.'],
 ['ACT VI','The Boiler Works','Steam hides the service exit. Three pressure wheels feed the release manifold.','Balance the boiler pressure without triggering the alarm.'],
 ['ACT VII','The Transport Garage','Prison vans wait behind a motorized shutter. One maintenance truck still has power.','Hot-wire the truck and open the garage shutter.'],
 ['ACT VIII','The Pursuit','The truck dies beyond the gate. Guards and dogs spill onto the rain-soaked service road behind you.','Sprint through the barricades and reach the getaway lights.'],
 ['ESCAPED','Beyond Blackridge','Rain falls on the empty road. Behind you, the prison siren finally dies.','You escaped Blackridge Penitentiary.']
];
